Subject: [PATCH] openbmc: add support for imx93-evk,frdm & imx91-evk

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [oe specific]

Signed-off-by: Nikhil Gupta <nikhil.gupta@nxp.com>
Signed-off-by: Manish Kumar Sharma <manishkumar.sharma@nxp.com>
Signed-off-by: Vaibhav Prakash Singh <vaibhavprakash.singh_1@nxp.com>
Signed-off-by: Arpit Goel <arpit.goel_2@nxp.com>
---
